  "_approach": "The default modern Afro house engine: steady 4x4 kick, a full 16th shaker with a strong-weak-medium-weak accent contour doing the driving, an understated clap on 2 and 4, offbeat open hats and a low conga answering the kick. Beatportal/IQSounds both stress that the shaker matters more than the clap here. Ref: Black Coffee 'Superman' (2010), Caiiro 'The Akan' (2017). (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
